  "judgment": {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "reasoning": "The vertex is (-3,-1), so write (y+1)^2=A(x+3). Substituting (-5,1) gives 4=-2A, hence A=-2. Option 2 eliminates t to give exactly (y+1)^2=-2(x+3), and all real t trace the entire parabola. This confirms the earlier answer and agrees with the captured worked solution.",
